    <string name="limits_title">Background monitoring limits</string>
    <string name="limits_text">Monitoring runs as a foreground service with a permanent notification. Battery savers or task killers may stop it, so there is no 24/7 guarantee. Telegram keeps undelivered messages for up to 24 hours and they arrive when monitoring resumes. Nothing is ever sent to a client without your review and your tap on Send.</string>
